1 tall slim young curly-haired cook with short happi coat and broad trousers working spatula;
2 large elderly female cook with wide gray bob and patterned wrap apron working tongs;
3 tiny middle-aged cook with thin ponytail and crossed sash brushing grill;
4 short round young cook with round glasses, cropped hair and rolled sleeves flipping food;
5 wide-hipped young cook with tall chef hat and narrow moustache stirring sauce;
6 older dango maker with long torso, short legs and wavy hair glazing dumpling skewer;
7 broad muscular dango maker with high bun and long open-front jacket shaping dumplings;
8 athletic middle-aged dango maker with side fringe and belted robe arranging skewer;
9 tall thin young dango maker with broad straw hat and wavy hair fanning a skewer;
10 tall potbellied elderly dango maker bald crown and big ears pouring sauce.
Hands carry portable tools, no large counters in sprites. 1120x1400-ish portrait sheet. True transparent alpha.
